Third-party attributions for Mockulus
=====================================

This file has two sections. The module-derived section is regenerated by CI
from the Go module graph (`go-licenses`); do not edit it by hand. The curated
section covers code vendored into this repository, which `go-licenses` cannot
see because it scans modules, not trees (SPEC §22.1).

Every dependency of the shipped binary must classify under one of:
Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, ISC. Copyleft licenses
(GPL/LGPL/AGPL/MPL) are denied with no exceptions.


